        // directly setting it via calling transferOwnership while we prank as owner if owner equals address(this). To get an
        // owner equal to vm.addr(ownerKey) we first ensure owner == address(0) and then if owner != desired owner, we perform
        // a two-step: make this contract the owner by deploying a temporary contract that is set as owner only if current owner is zero.
